<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-05T18:53:10.961Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 18:53:10 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistani security forces have repeatedly foiled infiltration attempts by Afghan Taliban elements along the Kurram border, arresting militants and repelling attacks on posts. In the same region, Pakistani troops crushed a Taliban-led aggression, while Afghan militants were detained alive after a border infiltration bid. Separate violence erupted in Rawalakot where security forces killed 18 people, including four children, during protests over basic rights. A bus-truck collision in Pakpattan caused 11 deaths and 33 injuries, and a shop roof collapse in Karachi killed one person. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQLW1uV0ZWajNkdHBSbzEyY25GSm9jU0U3VE1mUUNnNnFfVGI3S0VZdXZoOUxYTWVuZVg3NmJYb21saXVVTWpiV2M4R3ZoekFmYW5CTWpVQ3ZjRS1oYkExc3JrWWRqcTlMUEJZV0lWWlFzN2JNNTdSRjRyUmszNFJkTmIyeWJ2dlV6X1hmX1JZRU5YWDc1Wnh4UGZDN2dGSWlGNHVuUWpSZ09pUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOT1NwRnNjTzRXMFN3dndmcGdCMTdtSmttZERrUFVJMUR4QmFmVTFZM2RDOHZjbGs1ZUxqRW56ZWt4UjRKWXk1NENkNVdMTVVPVmdzNmxvRGh3OUVkMkNQdS01ektPR0N4RlNhbm9UWW00bVhOb2l4X29UcmRFd2ZNVlpNTE50Z1BpbmRnT0xPZHBual9feWp1dl8zaF9BRHN2d2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPZ1dLU1ptMTAtcGx4TE4xLVlxRXFjSG4wR2owRmctbmpSVmp5QXlMLXRmRkt4c2czZTNka3hJTmlHYmM1NUVpWF95Nm9xWElnTzVyUW9ibEV3a2hReWZQMWhfMm5jZzdMYWFJdjFFN3dvbkhMSlUtZ0hOT2hNdVhJUDdXVV9CT29TMlhoR3otclJQdjg3RTlJVS1tdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pakistan Connect&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiv